{
  "_comment": [
    "Sample sponsored brand auction response for previewing the three layouts without live campaigns.",
    "",
    "How to use it:",
    "1. Business Manager > Administration > Operations > Services > Credentials > the credential",
    "   used by the 'lapolar.topsort' service.",
    "2. Merge the 'runSponsoredBrandAuction' key below into the existing lpJSONConfig JSON, keeping",
    "   whatever 'runAuction' and 'sendEvent' entries are already there.",
    "3. Set the service profile to Mock (mockFull) and load any category page.",
    "",
    "IMPORTANT: replace every REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID value with product IDs that exist and are online",
    "in this instance. The cartridge drops products it cannot resolve, and skips a row entirely when",
    "fewer products survive than the format's minProducts, so fake IDs render nothing at all and log",
    "a message under the SponsoredBrands logger.",
    "",
    "The three results are positional: they line up with the enabled slots in",
    "cartridge/scripts/config/topsort_sponsored_brands.json, in that file's order."
  ],
  "runSponsoredBrandAuction": {
    "results": [
      {
        "resultType": "brand",
        "error": false,
        "winners": [
          {
            "rank": 1,
            "type": "url",
            "id": "https://www.example.com/marca-uno",
            "resolvedBidId": "mock-resolved-bid-hero-logo",
            "campaignId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a1",
            "vendorId": "mock-vendor-1",
            "title": "Marca Uno",
            "content": {
              "creative": "https://i.imgur.com/Qy1xFtZ.png",
              "logo": "https://i.imgur.com/Qy1xFtZ.png"
            },
            "productIds": [
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-1",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-2",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-3",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-4",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-5",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-6"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "resultType": "brand",
        "error": false,
        "winners": [
          {
            "rank": 1,
            "type": "url",
            "id": "https://www.example.com/marca-dos",
            "resolvedBidId": "mock-resolved-bid-hero",
            "campaignId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a2",
            "vendorId": "mock-vendor-2",
            "title": "Marca Dos",
            "content": {
              "creative": "https://i.imgur.com/Qy1xFtZ.png"
            },
            "productIds": [
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-1",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-2",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-3"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "resultType": "brand",
        "error": false,
        "winners": [
          {
            "rank": 1,
            "type": "product",
            "id": "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-1",
            "resolvedBidId": "mock-resolved-bid-compact",
            "campaignId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a3",
            "vendorId": "mock-vendor-3",
            "title": "Marca Tres",
            "content": {
              "logo": "https://i.imgur.com/Qy1xFtZ.png",
              "headline": "Lo mejor de la marca"
            },
            "productIds": [
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-1",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-2",
              "REPLACE-WITH-REAL-PID-3"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
